    <div style="margin-top:8px"><h2 style="font-size:24px; font-weight:800; color:#1B365D; letter-spacing:-0.3px; margin:0 0 6px">How this hub is organised</h2>
          <p style="font-size:14.5px; color:#5A6373; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 16px; max-width:760px">Three sensible ways to look for help with your books — and this hub supports all of them. The lenses overlap on purpose: one team combines them into a single scope rather than three engagements.</p>
          <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr)); gap:14px; margin-bottom:34px">
            <div style="background:#fff; border:1px solid #E7E8EC; border-radius:14px; padding:18px"><div style="font-size:15px; font-weight:800; color:#1B365D; margin-bottom:6px">By Process</div><div style="font-size:13px; color:#6B7280; line-height:1.55">A specific function is broken — AP, AR, reconciliations, MIS, year-end close.</div></div>
            <div style="background:#fff; border:1px solid #E7E8EC; border-radius:14px; padding:18px"><div style="font-size:15px; font-weight:800; color:#1B365D; margin-bottom:6px">By Software</div><div style="font-size:13px; color:#6B7280; line-height:1.55">Books on the platform you already run — Tally, Zoho, QuickBooks, Xero, Odoo.</div></div>
            <div style="background:#fff; border:1px solid #E7E8EC; border-radius:14px; padding:18px"><div style="font-size:15px; font-weight:800; color:#1B365D; margin-bottom:6px">By Industry</div><div style="font-size:13px; color:#6B7280; line-height:1.55">Sector rules handled — RERA escrow, FCRA funds, marketplace settlements and more.</div></div>
          </div>

          <div style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,#1B365D,#12294B); border-radius:16px; padding:26px 28px; margin-bottom:34px">
            <h2 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:800; color:#fff; margin:0 0 14px">What every engagement includes</h2>
            <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr)); gap:12px 26px">
              <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start"><span style="color:#FFB48C; font-weight:800">✓</span><span style="font-size:13.5px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.82); line-height:1.5">A dedicated accountant who learns your business</span></div>
              <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start"><span style="color:#FFB48C; font-weight:800">✓</span><span style="font-size:13.5px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.82); line-height:1.5">Maker-checker review by a CA before anything is filed</span></div>
              <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start"><span style="color:#FFB48C; font-weight:800">✓</span><span style="font-size:13.5px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.82); line-height:1.5">A compliance calendar that is owned, not assumed</span></div>
              <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start"><span style="color:#FFB48C; font-weight:800">✓</span><span style="font-size:13.5px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.82); line-height:1.5">Monthly reconciliations and reporting on a fixed date</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h2 style="font-size:24px; font-weight:800; color:#1B365D; letter-spacing:-0.3px; margin:0 0 14px">How to choose your starting point</h2>
          <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2px; margin-bottom:34px">
            <div style="display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:baseline; padding:12px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #ECEEF2"><span style="flex:1; font-size:14px; color:#374151; line-height:1.5">Books months behind, an audit or loan approaching</span><span style="flex:0 0 205px; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#E8712C">Catch-Up Bookkeeping</span></div>
            <div style="display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:baseline; padding:12px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #ECEEF2"><span style="flex:1; font-size:14px; color:#374151; line-height:1.5">Filings on time, but unsure which product or branch makes money</span><span style="flex:0 0 205px; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#E8712C">MIS Reporting</span></div>
            <div style="display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:baseline; padding:12px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #ECEEF2"><span style="flex:1; font-size:14px; color:#374151; line-height:1.5">Vendors calling about unpaid or double-paid invoices</span><span style="flex:0 0 205px; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#E8712C">Accounts Payable</span></div>
